add('BY','allowed','The EAEU regulated-product list expressly excludes consumer-packaged green and black tea from the corresponding phytosanitary-control entries. Sealed100g retail packs of plain sencha meet that commodity/packaging description.','The exclusion is commodity-based and applies to imports by post as well as other transport; no passenger allowance is being used.','Eurasian Economic Commission common quarantine list applicable in Belarus',['https://eec.eaeunion.org/upload/medialibrary/60f/x9vhmm3gi76102uwhqlv7iffol64r6lo/Perechen-produktsii.pdf'],attempts=['Read the official EEC list entries090210/090220 and their consumer-packaging exclusion; checked the shared source downloaded by Asia audit.'])
add('MC','allowed','Legal inference: the France–Monaco Customs Convention Articles1 and3 apply French customs and sanitary rules in Monaco. Under the French/EU regime, manufactured dried tea does not need phytosanitary certification; fresh tea-leaf controls do not describe steamed/dried sencha.','The convention applies to import legislation generally. EU private-order guidance confirms the finished-tea exemption also covers postal purchases.','Monaco official legislation service; France–Monaco Customs Convention; EU NPPO guidance',['https://legimonaco.mc/tai/convention/1963/05-18-tai1l000236/','https://www.douane.gouv.fr/demarche/importer-des-vegetaux-et-produits-vegetaux','https://jordbruksverket.se/languages/english/swedish-board-of-agriculture/plants/bringing-in-or-ordering-plants-and-plant-products-to-sweden-as-a-private-individual'],attempts=['Downloaded current Legimonaco treaty PDF; read Articles1 and3, then applied the verified EU dried-tea exemption.'])
add('BA','conditional','The destination’s UPU postal return expressly includes tea and exempts consignments for individuals in quantities intended for home use from its listed sanitary and market-inspection certificate requirements. A numeric personal-tea threshold is not specified.','This evidence specifically governs international postal consignments, unlike the separate traveller small-plant allowance.','Bosnia and Herzegovina UPU country return, republished by Guyana Post in August2024; Bosnia customs traveller guidance for comparison',['https://guypost.gy/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ListOfProhibitedArticles-updated.pdf','https://www.uino.gov.ba/portal/en/information-for-citizens-and-travelers-2/'],question='The tea-specific postal return is dated2016, although included in the2024 official compilation. Confirm with the Plant Health Administration whether any newer phytosanitary measure overrides the personal-home-use exemption and what quantity is accepted.',attempts=['Read UPU country return tea row on PDFp21; checked Bosnia customs guidance and separated its traveller-only fresh-plant allowances.'])
add('EG','conditional','Plant Quarantine Regulation562/2019 Annex10 item11 exempts personal-use consignments of already-admissible items up to50kg from both import permits and phytosanitary certificates, excluding propagation material. Plain manufactured tea is non-propagating, but the exemption does not itself establish the product/origin’s admissibility.','Regulation562 explicitly covers imported postal parcels; Annex10 item11 says personal-use consignments rather than limiting the exemption to passenger baggage. Inspection remains possible.','Egypt Central Administration of Plant Quarantine regulation filed by the NPPO with IPPC',['https://assets.ippc.int/static/media/files/reportingobligation/2021/09/24/eg3-2019-562pqreg_en.pdf'],limit={'netGrams':50000,'inclusive':True,'scope':'Personal-use consignment exemption from permit and phytosanitary certificate; applies only to items already allowed to be imported.'},question='Confirm CAPQ commodity/origin admission for manufactured Japanese Camellia sinensis tea: the published personal-use exemption is expressly conditional on the item already being allowed.',attempts=['Read NPPO-published regulation’s postal scope and Annex10 item11; searched the regulation for tea-specific restrictions and did not find a product entry.'])
